#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNDropProtectionCheckbox.java:87
msgid "VPN"
msgstr "VPN"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNDropProtectionCheckbox.java:97
