msgstr "-Drop zaštita"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNDropProtectionCheckbox.java:101
msgid ""
"When enabled, BitTorrent transfers will pause if your VPN is disconnected"
msgstr ""
"Kada je uključeno, BitTorrent prijenosi se pauziraju ako se VPN prekine"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:80
msgid ""
"Due to current settings without VPN connection BitTorrent will not start. "
"Click to see the settings screen"
msgstr ""
"Zbog trenutnih postavki bez VPN veze, BitTorrent se neće pokrenuti. Kliknite"
" da biste vidjeli zaslon postavki"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:84
msgid "VPN Off: BitTorrent disabled"
msgstr "VPN isključeno: BitTorrent je onemogućen"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:120
msgid ""
"FrostWire has detected a VPN connection, your privacy is safe from prying "
"eyes."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire je otkrio VPN vezu, vaša privatnost je sigurna od znatiželjnih "
"očiju."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:124
msgid ""
"FrostWire can't detect an encrypted VPN connection, your privacy is at risk."
" Click icon to set up an encrypted VPN connection."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire ne može otkriti šifriranu VPN vezu, vaša privatnost je pod "
"rizikom. Kliknite na ikonu kako biste postavili šifriranu VPN vezu."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:88
msgid "O&pen .Torrent, Magnet or Video URL"
msgstr "O&tvori .Torrent, Magnet ili Video URL"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:90
msgid "Opens a magnet link or torrent file"
msgstr "Otvara magnet poveznicu ili torrent datoteku"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:105
msgid "Download .Torrent or Magnet link"
msgstr "Preuzmi .Torrent ili Magnet link"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:133
msgid ""
"Type a magnet link, the file path or web address of a torrent file and "
